<title>USA: Sybron Intl completes CSM acquisition.</title>
<headline>Sybron Intl completes CSM acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sybron International Corp said Thursday it completed its acquisition of Carr-Scarborough Microbiologicals Inc (CSM).</p>
<p>CSM manufactures medical diagnostic products. It will be relocated in Lenexa, Kansas from Decatur, Georgia, and will be consolidated with Sybron's recently acquired Remel operation.</p>
<p>CSM sales during the last 12 months were about $9 million.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
